#. Description of the plugin
#: simply-events-calendar.php
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A simple, responsive events calendar for WordPress. Easily create one-time "
"or recurring events and display them anywhere with shortcodes, Elementor "
"widgets, and one-click Add to Calendar."
msgstr ""
"Un calendario de eventos simple y responsivo para WordPress. Crea fácilmente"
" eventos únicos o recurrentes y muéstralos en cualquier lugar con "
"shortcodes, widgets de Elementor y Añadir al calendario con un clic."

