#, fuzzy
msgid "Dynamic Tags"
msgstr "Etiquetas dinámicas"

#: includes/class-docs.php:191
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"In an event template or Loop Grid, you can also bind a native Elementor "
"widget (Heading, Text, Image, etc.) to an event field via its dynamic-tags "
"picker, under the \"Simple Events\" group: Event Date, Event Time, Event "
"Location, Event Title, Event Excerpt, Event Categories, and Event Image URL."
